Step 1:

cd shield_min_ws/src/shield_perception/scripts && conda activate zed_calib

step 2:

(make sure robot is on / in automatic mode / motor controller on)
	2a: shieldminld && roslaunch abb_robot_bringup_examples custom_moveit_setup.launch robot_ip:=192.168.55.1
	2b : abb_control
step 3:

take off shield, put on calibration end effector attachment

step 4:

move joints to [0 0 0 0 0 0]

step 5:

run camcalib.py

step 6:

run calibdata.py

step 7:
calibdata.py processes data and produces:

Camera base to left frame T: 
 [[ 0.83182232 -0.19390764 -0.52006869  0.79588413]
 [ 0.12945255  0.97892641 -0.15794027  0.23345217]
 [ 0.5397348   0.06405402  0.83939468  0.04414754]
 [ 0.          0.          0.          1.        ]]

step 8:

paste SE3 matrix into constants.py and add a comment for logging

